CTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/47487#issuecomment-942937186\u003e 関数→インターフェイスの暗黙変換すら許容してもいいんじゃないかという Ian の提案","ts":"1634188436.341600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/47487#issuecomment-942937186|Comment on #47487 proposal: spec: allow explicit conversion from function to 1-method interface\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/47487#issuecomment-942937186|Comment on #47487 proposal: spec: allow explicit conversion from function to 1-method interface\u003e","text":"Does this proposal work like this? If not, why not? Thanks.\n\n```\ntype F func()\ntype (f F) M() { fmt.Println(\"F.M\") }\ntype I interface { M() }\nvar FI F = func() { fmt.Println(\"FI\") }\nvar V1 I = FI\nvar V2 = I(FI)\nfunc main() {\n    fmt.Printf(\"%T\\n\", V1) // prints I\n    fmt.Printf(\"%T\\n\", V2) // prints I\n    V1.M() // prints F.M\n    V2.M() // prints FI\n}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go|golang/go\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634185767}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ckq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc4ccaca-5305-473e-9452-c1f45e3a4a8c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あとでやってみるかな…","ts":"1634181593.340800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+fJPK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c946d946-6b01-4c12-87bf-a5142f3c8e80","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"英語も書けないし、実装のあたりも無いので、私には厳しいので、どなたか","ts":"1634181585.340400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Py"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a58770b1-6ac9-459a-8f96-3c0894d06dd4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"型名と関数名をアンダースコアでくっつける、とかでも十分かもしれない","ts":"1634181581.340300","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"