一引数をレシーバにするような関数にすればいいのでは","ts":"1634179729.333500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zA=y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f500255-5da3-4dca-bb6c-188af4453426","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Goのメソッドをexportする方法って流石にないよなあ。あったら便利すぎて死ぬのでなくて大丈夫\nexportできるのはグローバル関数だけ","ts":"1634179606.332900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q5X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2898b16-f9c9-4699-ba58-72143f88c6ef","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なるほどですね","ts":"1634179537.332200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GRdl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14266c9c-ced8-4922-89cd-ff8df59b455e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"はい。いずれ go-pointer 使ってるところこれで置き換えないとなぁと思っているところ。","ts":"1634179494.331900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U7WFYQ5HU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YH3h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6d87921-07a2-426c-91f4-a4a5e06ad802","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"1.17だ、見てなかった\n\u003chttps://golang.org/doc/go1.17#runtime/cgo\u003e","ts":"1634178560.331300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Go 1.17 Release Notes - The Go Programming Language","id":1,"title":"Go 1.17 Release Notes - The Go Programming Language","title_link":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#runtime/cgo","text":"Go is an open source programming language that makes it easy to build simple, reliable, and efficient software.","blocks":null,"service_name":"golang.org","service_icon":"https://golang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#runtime/cgo","original_url":"https://golang.org/doc/go1.17#runtime/cgo"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wpoM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4522b055-4de6-4622-9479-96b20fad9326","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/37033\u003e\n1.17?","ts":"1634178476.330900","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/37033|#37033 runtime: provide centralized facility for managing (c)go pointer handles\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go/issues/37033|#37033 runtime: provide centralized facility for managing (c)go pointer handles\u003e","text":"Any non-trivial program relying on cgo eventually will find itself in need to use callbacks and interact with go objects. The current \"customary\" way to deal with this situation is for package implementer to come with some sort of global map to establish correspondence between go pointers and some sort of custom cgo handle.\n\n(I'm talking about pointers to complex go objects, which are normally disallowed by cgo call checker).\n\nThis is unfortunate, as many cgo enabled packages are required to carry boilerplate code with a lot of potential for hard to find bugs, such as:\n\n1. Handle assignment collisions\n2. Pointer \"leaks\"\n3. Concurrency issues, accessing those \"pointer to handle\" maps\n\nTherefore, it will be nice if go runtime provided a small API to handle the above case cleanly, to the tune of:\n\n```\n// Make i non-collectable and non-movable and return a cgo handle h for it\nfunc cgoMakeHandle(i interface{}) (h uintptr)\n\n// Given a cgo handle, return a Go reference for the object, if valid\nfunc cgoGetHandle(h uintptr) (i interface{}, ok bool)\n\n// Same as \"get\" above, but the handle h becomes invalid, and reference i becomes collectable\n// and movable again\nfunc cgoReleaseHandle(h uintptr) (i interface{}, ok bool)\n\n```\n\nThe `h` handle, while valid, is then supposed to be safely passable to native code and back.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"help wanted, Proposal, Proposal-Accepted, NeedsFix","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"21","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/golang/go|golang/go\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1580870677}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a7hy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"236af2a3-ed19-48ee-8d09-d783cdf02531","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go 1.16 からだったかな?","ts":"1634178357.330700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ddbj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb4a151b-342b-48f9-8388-72fcb264a037","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あーそんなものが","ts":"1634178270.330400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U7P5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40de85ec-5f0d-4ed2-9812-75f9a80c2745","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle\u003e cgo.Handle のほうがよいのでは","ts":"1634178013.330000","attachments":[{"fallback":"cgo package - runtime/cgo - pkg.go.dev","id":1,"title":"cgo package - runtime/cgo - pkg.go.dev","title_link":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle","text":"Package cgo contains runtime support for code generated by the cgo tool.","blocks":null,"service_name":"pkg.go.dev","service_icon":"https://pkg.go.dev/static/shared/icon/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle","original_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/runtime/cgo#Handle"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IkQ3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a787d398-bd6c-4dcd-adcf-28a6ada7cd22","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"結局GoのポインタをCに渡す方法はmattn/go-pointerを使うのが正解ってことかな\ngo-sqlite3でやってるハックと全く同じものがgo-pointerに切り出されてるっていう\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3/blob/3392062c729d77820afc1f5cae3427f0de39e954/callback.go#L109\u003e\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-pointer/blob/master/pointer.go\u003e\nなんか、調べても意外と情報が出てこないので、もっと布教してもいいかもと思ったけど、そもそもこんなことする機会がないか。","ts":"1634176649.329700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3/blob/3392062c729d77820afc1f5cae3427f0de39e954/callback.go | callback.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3/blob/3392062c729d77820afc1f5cae3427f0de39e954/callback.go | callback.go\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3|mattn/go-sqlite3\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"},{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-pointer/blob/master/pointer.go | pointer.go\u003e","id":2,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-pointer/blob/master/pointer.go | pointer.go\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-pointer|mattn/go-pointer\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RZ5"}]}]
